OL,3,AUK believes Iran involved in RAF
OL,4,AFairford incident, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked why the suspects had been
OL,7,Freleased on bail - a decision which has
OL,8,Fbeen openly questioned by President
OL,9,FDonald Trump - the prime minister
OL,10,Finsisted the men were subject to the
OL,11,F"strictest possible bail conditions"
OL,12,Fand added that UK authorities "have
OL,13,Fthis under the strongest grip and
OL,14,Fclosest control".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
