OL,3,AResidents near RAF Fairford left 'like
OL,4,Asitting ducks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near RAF Fairford say
OL,7,Fthey have been "left feeling like
OL,8,Fsitting ducks" at the centre of major
OL,9,Fcounter-terrorism probe.
OL,11,FFive men were arrested on suspicion of
OL,12,Fthe preparation of a terrorist act
OL,13,Fafter three vans were spotted near the
OL,14,FGloucestershire base, which the US
OL,15,Fmilitary operates.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
