OL,3,ABrexit referendum 'possible' in Labour
OL,4,Aelection manifesto, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said it is "possible"
OL,7,Fa future Labour election manifesto
OL,8,Fcould promise a new in-out referendum
OL,9,Fon the European Union.
OL,11,FThe prime minister told the BBC a
OL,12,Freferendum "wouldn't be the right thing
OL,13,Fto do right now" but the UK needed to
OL,14,F"consider the options" for its future
OL,15,Frelationship with the EU as "where we
OL,16,Fare isn't good enough".
OL,18,FIt comes after he pledged in his Labour
OL,19,Fconference speech on Tuesday to explore
OL,20,Fcloser ties with the bloc at a summit
OL,21,Flater this year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
