OL,3,ABrexit referendum 'possible' in Labour
OL,4,Aelection manifesto, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move could set up a huge dividing
OL,7,Fline at the next general election, with
OL,8,Fthe Conservatives accusing Burnham of
OL,9,Ftrying to "reopen old wounds by
OL,10,Frestarting the battles of the Brexit
OL,11,Fyears".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
