OL,3,AExecution of US murderer Christa Pike
OL,4,Ahalted shortly before it was due to
OL,5,Ahappen
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe execution of Tennessee inmate
OL,8,FChrista Pike has been halted just over
OL,9,Fan hour before it was due to happen.
OL,11,FPike, 50, has been awaiting execution
OL,12,Fsince she was convicted and sentenced
OL,13,Fto death in 1996 for the murder of
OL,14,FColleen Slemmer.
OL,16,FIn their ruling on Wednesday, judges
OL,17,Ffrom the Sixth Circuit Appeals court
OL,18,Fsaid they needed more time to consider
OL,19,Fthe arguments in Pike's case. It is
OL,20,Funclear how long the pause will last.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
